{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hollow_priest","model_identifier":"hollow_priest","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# hollow_priest\n\nHollow priest (C1), walker and caster, 1.9 m = 68 u (hood to 70 u).\n\nTall and thin, in a tattered black robe with violet panels and a ragged violet mantle, a deep hood over a dry skull face with purple eye lights, bony hands, and a crooked staff topped with a cracked purple crystal (glow_crystal, `fx_crystal` at its centre). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..9.0, y 0.0..70.0, z -6.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 70 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.72 | loop |  |\n| `cast_curse` | 1.5 | once | key 0.75 s: the crystal is thrust at the target (non-projectile curse: apply it at the target at this moment) |\n| `raise_dead` | 2.6 | once | key 1.4 s: staff butt struck down; spawn the zombie at the target spot and play its `rise` clip |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | staff and arm raised wide, head tilts |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 41.6 u per cycle (staff as a walking stick)\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.72 s, 66.6 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_curse`: key 0.75 s: the crystal is thrust at the target (non-projectile curse: apply it at the target at this moment)\n- `raise_dead`: key 1.4 s: staff butt struck down; spawn the zombie at the target spot and play its `rise` clip\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 70, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 48, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 52.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 58.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 46, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 31.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 39.25, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 31.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 36, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 36, 2.5)\n- `fx_crystal` on `crooked_staff` at (7.5, 33, -28)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `crooked_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 1.9 m (55 u visible), grip at the origin, crystal end along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crystal are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# hollow_priest\n\nHollow priest (C1), walker and caster, 1.9 m = 68 u (hood to 70 u).\n\nTall and thin, in a tattered black robe with violet panels and a ragged violet mantle, a deep hood over a dry skull face with purple eye lights, bony hands, and a crooked staff topped with a cracked purple crystal (glow_crystal, `fx_crystal` at its centre). Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 31 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.0..9.0, y 0.0..70.0, z -6.0..5.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 16 x 70 x 14 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.3 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.72 | loop |  |\n| `cast_curse` | 1.5 | once | key 0.75 s: the crystal is thrust at the target (non-projectile curse: apply it at the target at this moment) |\n| `raise_dead` | 2.6 | once | key 1.4 s: staff butt struck down; spawn the zombie at the target spot and play its `rise` clip |\n| `aggro` | 1.6 | once | staff and arm raised wide, head tilts |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch from the front |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n| `burn` | 1.3 | loop | writhing in sunlight (loop) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 32.0 u/s (0.90 m/s), cycle 1.3 s, 41.6 u per cycle (staff as a walking stick)\n- `run`: 92.4 u/s (2.60 m/s), cycle 0.72 s, 66.6 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `cast_curse`: key 0.75 s: the crystal is thrust at the target (non-projectile curse: apply it at the target at this moment)\n- `raise_dead`: key 1.4 s: staff butt struck down; spawn the zombie at the target spot and play its `rise` clip\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 70, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 48, 4.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 52.5, 4.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 58.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 46, -4.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7.5, 31.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10.5, 39.25, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7.5, 31.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 36, 2.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 36, 2.5)\n- `fx_crystal` on `crooked_staff` at (7.5, 33, -28)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `crooked_staff` (visible, under slot_hand_r): about 1.9 m (55 u visible), grip at the origin, crystal end along -Z, butt along +Z\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l and glow_crystal are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,33.0,-3.0],"to":[4.5,38.0,3.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,33.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[88,61,97.0,66.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[106,61,112.0,66.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[97,61,106.0,66.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[112,61,1